<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>M'VOLA — CASH POINT</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#f5f7fa;
color:#172033
}

header{
position:sticky;
top:0;
z-index:20;
background:#1565c0;
color:white;
padding:14px 12px;
box-shadow:0 2px 8px #0002
}

header h1{
margin:0 0 10px;
font-size:22px
}

nav{
display:flex;
gap:6px;
overflow-x:auto
}

nav button{
border:0;
border-radius:8px;
padding:9px 11px;
background:#fff;
color:#1565c0;
font-weight:bold;
white-space:nowrap
}

main{
max-width:900px;
margin:auto;
padding:14px
}

.page{
display:none
}

.page.active{
display:block
}

.card{
background:white;
border-radius:12px;
padding:15px;
margin-bottom:14px;
box-shadow:0 2px 8px #0001
}

h2,h3{
margin-top:0
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
gap:10px
}

@media(max-width:600px){
.grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr
}
}

label{
display:block;
font-weight:bold;
margin-bottom:5px
}

input,select,button{
font:inherit
}

input,select{
width:100%;
padding:11px;
border:1px solid #ccd4df;
border-radius:8px;
background:white
}

.action{
width:100%;
border:0;
border-radius:9px;
padding:12px;
margin-top:8px;
background:#1565c0;
color:white;
font-weight:bold
}

.action.secondary{
background:#455a64
}

.action.success{
background:#2e7d32
}

.action.warning{
background:#ef6c00
}

.action.danger{
background:#c62828
}

.result{
background:#eef5ff;
border-left:4px solid #1565c0;
padding:12px;
border-radius:7px;
margin-top:12px
}

.total{
font-size:20px;
font-weight:bold
}

.ok{
color:#2e7d32;
font-weight:bold
}

.bad{
color:#c62828;
font-weight:bold
}

.warn{
background:#fff3cd;
border-left:4px solid #f0ad00;
padding:12px;
border-radius:7px
}

table{
width:100%;
border-collapse:collapse;
background:white
}

th,td{
border:1px solid #d7dde5;
padding:8px;
text-align:left
}

th{
background:#eaf2fb
}

.table-wrap{
overflow:auto
}

.hidden{
display:none
}

.small{
font-size:13px;
color:#5b6575
}

.denom-row{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr 100px 1fr;
gap:8px;
align-items:center;
margin-bottom:7px
}

@media(max-width:500px){
.denom-row{
grid-template-columns:1fr 75px 1fr
}
}

.denom-total{
font-weight:bold;
text-align:right
}

.offer{
border:1px solid #d7dde5;
border-radius:9px;
padding:10px;
margin:7px 0
}

.offer button{
margin-top:7px
}

pre.ussd{
white-space:pre-wrap;
background:#172033;
color:#fff;
border-radius:8px;
padding:12px;
overflow:auto
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<h1>💙 M'VOLA — CASH POINT</h1>

<nav>
<button onclick="ouvrirPage('accueil')">Accueil</button>
<button onclick="ouvrirPage('travail')">Travail</button>
<button onclick="ouvrirPage('operations')">Opérations</button>
<button onclick="ouvrirPage('ussd')">USSD</button>
<button onclick="ouvrirPage('frais')">Frais</button>
<button onclick="ouvrirPage('contacts')">Contacts</button>
</nav>

</header>

<main>

<section id="accueil" class="page active">

<div class="card">

<h2>Accueil</h2>

<p>Gestion rapide de votre activité Cash Point.</p>

<button class="action"
onclick="ouvrirPage('travail')">
Début / Fin de travail
</button>

<button class="action"
onclick="ouvrirPage('operations')">
Transfert / Crédit / Forfait
</button>

<button class="action"
onclick="ouvrirPage('ussd')">
Codes USSD
</button>

<button class="action"
onclick="ouvrirPage('frais')">
Frais de service
</button>

<button class="action"
onclick="ouvrirPage('contacts')">
Contacts
</button>

</div>

</section>


<section id="travail" class="page">

<div class="card">

<h2>Début de travail</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div>
<label>Argent compte / téléphone (Ar)</label>
<input
id="debutCompte"
type="number"
min="0">
</div>

<div>
<label>Argent physique (Ar)</label>
<input
id="debutCash"
type="number"
min="0">
</div>

</div>

<button
class="action success"
onclick="debutTravail()">
Enregistrer le début
</button>

<div
id="resumeDebut"
class="result">
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h2>Fin de travail</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div>
<label>Argent compte / téléphone (Ar)</label>
<input
id="finCompte"
type="number"
min="0">
</div>

<div>
<label>Argent physique (Ar)</label>
<input
id="finCash"
type="number"
min="0">
</div>

</div>

<button
class="action warning"
onclick="finTravail()">
Enregistrer la fin
</button>

<div
id="resumeFin"
class="result">
</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="operations" class="page">

<div class="card">

<h2>Opérations</h2>

<label>Choisir l'opération</label>

<select
id="operationSelect"
onchange="onOperationChange()">

<option value="transfert">
Transfert
</option>

<option value="credit">
Achat Crédit
</option>

<option value="forfait">
Achat Forfait
</option>

</select>

</div>


<div id="transfertBox" class="card">

<h2>💸 Transfert</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div>

<label>Opérateur</label>

<select id="transfertOperateur">

<option value="mvola">
MVola
</option>

<option value="orange">
Orange Money
</option>

<option value="airtel">
Airtel Money
</option>

</select>

</div>


<div>

<label>
Numéro du bénéficiaire
</label>

<input
id="transfertNumero"
type="tel"
placeholder="03xxxxxxxx">

</div>

</div>


<label style="margin-top:10px">
Montant à envoyer (Ar)
</label>

<input
id="transfertMontant"
type="number"
min="0"
placeholder="Exemple : 20000"
oninput="calculerTransfert()">


<div
id="transfertCalcul"
class="result">

Entrez le montant à envoyer pour calculer automatiquement les frais.

</div>


<button
class="action"
onclick="preparerTransfert()">

Afficher le code USSD

</button>


<div
id="transfertUssd"
class="result hidden">

</div>


<div
class="card"
style="margin-top:14px;padding:12px;background:#f8fafc">

<h3>
💵 Fanisana vola azon'ny client
</h3>

<p class="small">

Ampidiro ny isan'ny billets/pièces.
Ny app dia manisa Ar sy FMG ary mampitaha
amin'ny total tokony haloan'ny client.

</p>

<div id="denominations">
</div>

<div class="result">

<div>
Total fanisana:
<span
id="cashCountAr"
class="total">
0 Ar
</span>
</div>

<div>
Total FMG:
<span
id="cashCountFmg"
class="total">
0 FMG
</span>
</div>

<div id="cashDifference">
Ampidiro ny fanisana.
</div>

</div>

<button
class="action success"
onclick="verifierFanisana()">

Vérifier la somme

</button>

</div>

</div>


<div
id="creditBox"
class="card hidden">

<h2>📱 Achat Crédit</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div>

<label>Opérateur</label>

<select id="creditOperateur">

<option value="mvola">
MVola
</option>

<option value="orange">
Orange Money
</option>

<option value="airtel">
Airtel Money
</option>

</select>

</div>

<div>

<label>Numéro</label>

<input
id="creditNumero"
type="tel">

</div>

</div>

<label style="margin-top:10px">
Montant (Ar)
</label>

<input
id="creditMontant"
type="number"
min="0">

<button
class="action"
onclick="preparerCredit()">

Afficher le code USSD

</button>

<div
id="creditUssd"
class="result hidden">
</div>

</div>


<div
id="forfaitBox"
class="card hidden">

<h2>📶 Achat Forfait</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div>

<label>Opérateur</label>

<select
id="forfaitOperateur"
onchange="afficherOffres()">

<option value="mvola">
MVola
</option>

<option value="orange">
Orange Money
</option>

<option value="airtel">
Airtel Money
</option>

</select>

</div>

<div>

<label>Numéro</label>

<input
id="forfaitNumero"
type="tel">

</div>

</div>

<div
id="offresBox"
class="result">
</div>

</div>

</section>
